{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104251","id":2396301650,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6O1KlS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104251/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104251/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c3ce16c45c2d047d644d9c728ec905e052d0c62d","number":104251,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement alignment (size-relative offset) for sprite nodes","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9222.\r\n\r\nIntroduces a new property to all sprite nodes (Sprite2D, AnimatedSprite2D, Sprite3D & AnimatedSprite3D) that acts an offset relative to (i.e multiplied by) the texture dimensions. This provides a convenient way to easily align pivots to any corner or border of the sprite without needing to take size into account, in a way that still works well alongside the existing `centered` property (for compatibility, even though that property is arguably made redundant by this feature).\r\n\r\nThe property can be set to any vector2, but to support the intended common case the slider in the inspector has the range needed to allow aligning to any corner and no more -- which means -0.5..0.5 when `centered` is true, and -1.0..0 when it's false. For example, this means you can easily align a sprite's pivot to its center-bottom by dragging the `alignment.y` slider to the leftmost position\r\n\r\nI'm not entirely sure on the name `alignment`, but it's the best I could think of that is succinct and clearly distinguishes it from `offset`.\r\n\r\nThis MR implements an (incompatible) alternative solution to parts of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93538","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arch